.TH DIARY 1 "2026-11-01" "diary 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
diary \- a terminal-first journal that typesets monthly PDFs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B diary
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fITEXT\fR...]
.br
.B diary
\fIwrite\fR|\fIedit\fR|\fIopen\fR|\fIbuild\fR|\fIlist\fR|\fIhelp\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B diary
stores entries as Markdown in a monthly folder and typesets each month into a
ruled PDF with Tectonic (XeTeX). Entries are grouped by day and stamped with the
local time at which they were saved.
.PP
With no arguments,
.B diary
opens your editor for a new entry. Text arguments add a quick entry, and text
piped on standard input is read from the pipe.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B write
Write a new entry in your editor.
.TP
.B edit
Edit the current month's
.I entries.md
and rebuild the PDF if it changed.
.TP
.B open
Open the current month's PDF, building it first if needed.
.TP
.B build
Rebuild the current month's PDF.
.TP
.B list
List all months, entry counts, last entry dates, and PDF availability.
.TP
.B help
Show the built-in help text.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-date " YYYY-MM-DD"
Add an entry to another day and its month.
.TP
.BI \-\-month " YYYY-MM"
Choose a month for
.BR edit ,
.BR open ,
or
.BR build .
.TP
.B \-\-no\-open
Do not launch the PDF viewer after building.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show the built-in help text.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DIARY_DIR
Diary root directory. Default:
.I ~/Documents/diary
.TP
.B DIARY_TEMPLATE
LaTeX template used for PDF generation. Default: the
.I template.tex
installed with the package.
.TP
.B DIARY_TECTONIC
Path to a specific Tectonic executable.
.TP
.B DIARY_EDITOR
Editor command for entries. Falls back to
.BR VISUAL ,
then
.BR EDITOR .
.TP
.B DIARY_NO_OPEN
Set to
.B 1
to never launch the PDF viewer.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Documents/diary/YYYY-MM Month/entries.md
The source of truth for the month.
.TP
.I ~/Documents/diary/YYYY-MM Month/Month YYYY.pdf
The typeset month.
.TP
.I ~/Documents/diary/YYYY-MM Month/.build/
Generated LaTeX and build log; safe to delete.
.SH EXAMPLES
Write a new entry in your editor:
.PP
.RS 4
diary
.RE
.PP
Add a quick entry:
.PP
.RS 4
diary "Rain all afternoon. Read by the window."
.RE
.PP
Add an entry to an older day:
.PP
.RS 4
diary \-\-date 2026-10-20 "A note I forgot to add."
.RE
.PP
Open another month:
.PP
.RS 4
diary open \-\-month 2026-09
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tectonic (1),
.BR xdg-open (1)
